{"id":"36a464dda4de9f60","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-attaching-map.md","title":"Attaching Map","display":"df-attaching-map — Attaching Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-attaching-map","aliases":["58-df-attaching-map","Attaching Map"],"display":"df-attaching-map — Attaching Map","depends_on":["[[58-df-sphere]]","[[../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-attaching-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-attaching-map</span><span>Attaching Map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-attaching-map — Attaching Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed44d43cf74ca35e\" href=\"?note=ed44d43cf74ca35e\" title=\"58-df-sphere\">58-df-sphere</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b2e63b755a37f1dc\" href=\"?note=b2e63b755a37f1dc\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md\">../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land X,\\tau_X,\\phi\\in V\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land X,\\tau_X,\\phi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{n-1}\\in V\\land\\tau_{S^{n-1}}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(S^{n-1})\">\\(S^{n-1}\\in V\\land\\tau_{S^{n-1}}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(S^{n-1})\\)</span> (sphere and its standard topology, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed44d43cf74ca35e\" href=\"?note=ed44d43cf74ca35e\" title=\"58-df-sphere\">58-df-sphere</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (continuous-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b2e63b755a37f1dc\" href=\"?note=b2e63b755a37f1dc\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md\">../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AttachingMap}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{AttachingMap}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (attaching-map predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}attaching\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{AttachingMap}_S(\\phi,X,\\tau_X,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S(\\phi,S^{n-1},\\tau_{S^{n-1}},X,\\tau_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}attaching\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{AttachingMap}_S(\\phi,X,\\tau_X,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S(\\phi,S^{n-1},\\tau_{S^{n-1}},X,\\tau_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Attaching map: glues <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^n\">\\(D^n\\)</span> along its boundary to existing space</li>\n<li>CW complex: spaces built by iteratively attaching cells along maps</li>\n<li>Homotopy type of attached cells: attaching maps determine new topology</li>\n<li>For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq2\">\\(n\\geq2\\)</span>, the attached-cell homotopy and homology effects are treated as downstream propositions, not as part of this definition.</li>\n<li>Handle decomposition: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^n\">\\(D^n\\)</span> is a 0-handle; attachments of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^n\">\\(D^n\\)</span> along <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{n-1}\">\\(S^{n-1}\\)</span> are handles</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Whitehead, Elements of Homotopy Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-sphere","status":"resolved","id":"ed44d43cf74ca35e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sphere]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"b2e63b755a37f1dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sphere","status":"resolved","id":"ed44d43cf74ca35e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S^{n-1}\\in V\\land\\tau_{S^{n-1}}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(S^{n-1})$ (sphere and its standard topology, see [[58-df-sphere]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"b2e63b755a37f1dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (continuous-map predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land X,\\tau_X,\\phi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"S^{n-1}\\in V\\land\\tau_{S^{n-1}}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(S^{n-1})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AttachingMap}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}attaching\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{AttachingMap}_S(\\phi,X,\\tau_X,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S(\\phi,S^{n-1},\\tau_{S^{n-1}},X,\\tau_X)","display":true},{"tex":"D^n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq2","display":false},{"tex":"D^n","display":false},{"tex":"D^n","display":false},{"tex":"S^{n-1}","display":false}],"bytes":1464,"backlinks":[{"id":"421255505c63a270","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AttachingMap}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-attaching-map.md]])."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-attaching-map.md|58-df-attaching-map]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["ed44d43cf74ca35e","b2e63b755a37f1dc"]}